{"key":"c49444bfcfee7551","source_file":"Potts Ba - Bi.json","source_id":5193,"source_url":"concordance-balance-ppl-trutina","term":"Balance","headwords":["Balance"],"latin":["Trutina"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Balance"],"latin":["Trutina"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["AC","HH"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"3110","subsection":"end"},"text":"A more delicate balance... (Compare AC 3116.)","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"HH","section":"593","subsection":null},"text":"The equilibrium between the Heavens and the Hells is lessened and augmented... To know and perceive this, and to regulate it to a balance, and equalize it, is what no Angel can do, but the Lord alone...","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"balance-c49444","url":"/meta/potts/balance-c49444/"}